<title>SPAIN: Spain's Acerinox 96 net falls 56.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Acerinox 96 net falls 56.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full 1996 group results for Spanish steel company Acerinox, in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Attributable net			   14.86  vs   34.39</p>
<p> Net profit				   14.90  vs   34.83</p>
<p> Pretax profit				18.36  vs   48.08</p>
<p> Turnover				    180.89  vs  212.42</p>
<p> Net cash flow			     23.87  down  44.6%</p>
<p> Gross operating result		  26.33  vs    62.17</p>
<p> Net operating result		    17.92  vs    52.54</p>
<p> Financial costs			   (1.70) vs    (3.20)</p>
<p> Ordinary result			   17.03  vs    50.19</p>
<p>NOTE - The company added that the main reason behind the fall in the net cash flow was due to the international trend of the stainless steel prices.</p>
<p>Parent company showed a net profit at 14.9 billion pesetas, down 45.1 percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
